    "title": "Google Pixel Watch",
    "description": "Set up and manage your Google Pixel Watch right from your Android 8.0+ device with the Google Pixel Watch app. You can easily customize your watch faces, set up Google Assistant and Google Wallet, manage notifications and more.\r\n\r\nHere are some of the things you can do with the Google Pixel Watch app:\r\n\u2022 Customize watchfaces\r\n\u2022 Manage tiles\r\n\u2022 Customize alerts and notifications\r\n\u2022 Manage Google apps and accounts\r\n\u2022 Install and manage apps\r\n\u2022 Set up mobile carrier (available for selected countries and carriers only). Info at g.co/pixelwatch/networkinfo\r\n\u2022 Manage privacy settings\r\n\r\nGoogle Pixel Watch is only available in the following countries: United States, Canada, Australia, Japan, Germany, France, United Kingdom, Ireland, Taiwan",
